OL,3,GNEWSAMP faces attempt to block her from
OL,4,Adefending seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester East MP Shivani Raja has
OL,7,Ffaced an attempt to block her standing
OL,8,Fas a candidate in the next general
OL,9,Felection.
OL,11,FThe Leicester Conservative Federation
OL,12,F(LCF) met at the end of September to
OL,13,Fvote on whether Raja would be selected
OL,14,Fto defend the seat she won in 2024.
OL,16,FThe BBC understand she narrowly lost
OL,17,Fthe secret ballot and was not
OL,18,Freadopted.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
